<title>UK: Cookson flags 25 mln stg charge in H2.</title>
<headline>Cookson flags 25 mln stg charge in H2.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cookson Group Plc, manufacturer of industrial coatings, warned on Thursday that a 25 million stg one-off charge would arise in its second half results.</p>
<p>The charge relates to further streamlining within the group. Cookson said the plan will be implemented over the next few months. Payback on this rationalisation is forseen within two to three years, it said.</p>
<p>The move is seen improving the competitiveness of the group.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 5427717</p>
</text>
